# caption: Enumerate dictionary candidates through an implicit unit-edit FST product.

REQUIRE query x, trie, nonnegative radius k, expansion budget
ENSURE complete minimum-cost candidate set, or explicit budget exhaustion
distance of (0,root) is zero; insert it into a min-priority queue
WHILE queue is nonempty DO
  remove a minimum-cost state; ignore stale entries
  charge expansion budget; abort without claiming completeness if exhausted
  record final dictionary word if all query symbols are consumed
  relax deletion, insertion, and copy/substitution transitions within k
END WHILE
return distinct candidate words with their minimum costs

